{"3051160": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Black State", "steam_appid": 3051160, "required_age": "17", "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An action-packed third-person shooter with stunning visuals and high performance. A secret scientist organization summons you for a mysterious mission; rescue captives and uncover the truth behind a cataclysmic event. But beyond the portal doors lies an unknown fate. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Black State, you'll have to stay sharp. As you search for the captives and piece together what really happened, you'll face relentless threats, hostile human forces and deadly Robosapien enemies patrolling every corner. And the bosses? They’re beyond anything you’ve ever faced. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step carefully, every door you open could lead to salvation or straight into a nightmare. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to open them?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Real-Time Portal Doors</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3051160/extras/855bc652ba43040ae4697c06c8ecc80a.poster.avif?t=1786962680\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3051160/extras/855bc652ba43040ae4697c06c8ecc80a.webm?t=1786962680\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3051160/extras/855bc652ba43040ae4697c06c8ecc80a.mp4?t=1786962680\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Black State, some doors are anything but ordinary. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What seems like a normal doorway can open instantly into a completely different location. In a split second, you can move between places that feel wildly different from one another. No waiting. Just pure, seamless portal traversal. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To save captives and uncover the truth, you must pass through these unpredictable portals. Each one may lead to a hidden secret, a dangerous encounter, a striking new environment, or an unexpected adventure. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every portal pulls you deeper into the unknown, constantly taking you somewhere new, surprising, and unlike anywhere you have just been. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Where will your next step take you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Weapons &amp; Tactical Gadgets</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3051160/extras/3547e18422ab5b39b42d6fc9c4e833b9.poster.avif?t=1786962680\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3051160/extras/3547e18422ab5b39b42d6fc9c4e833b9.webm?t=1786962680\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3051160/extras/3547e18422ab5b39b42d6fc9c4e833b9.mp4?t=1786962680\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival in the Black State depends on how well you wield your weapons and gadgets. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pistols and rifles keep you steady, while a shotgun tears enemies apart at close range in a single blast. The fusion gun? Handle with care, it's sheer power paints the walls with blood. And you haven’t seen everything yet. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your tactical gadgets can turn the tide, whether you take a stealthy approach or unleash total chaos. Just look at your target, throw, and let them do the work. But choose wisely, not every gadget is effective against all enemies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When time slows down, every move matters. Think fast, act smart, and stay alive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enemies &amp; Close Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3051160/extras/cf26c5275704d82ace0b3381a906e762.poster.avif?t=1786962680\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3051160/extras/cf26c5275704d82ace0b3381a906e762.webm?t=1786962680\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3051160/extras/cf26c5275704d82ace0b3381a906e762.mp4?t=1786962680\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Human and robotic soldiers are relentless hunters, built to corner and overwhelm you. Enemies come in many forms, and each one brings a different kind of danger. If the situation escalates, they can call in reinforcements, and that is when the robotic units arrive. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hiding will not save you. They will flank, adapt, and hunt you down. And against some of them, bullets alone will not be enough. When enemies get too close, you can turn the fight in your favor with brutal close-range takedowns, and even chain them together to eliminate multiple threats in quick succession.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Underestimate them, and you won’t live to regret it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Boss Fights</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3051160/extras/7af32b0a43f62b37cde39c1eb6095eb2.poster.avif?t=1786962680\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3051160/extras/7af32b0a43f62b37cde39c1eb6095eb2.webm?t=1786962680\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3051160/extras/7af32b0a43f62b37cde39c1eb6095eb2.mp4?t=1786962680\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every boss has their own unique style and attack patterns. You must learn and adapt. Do not be fooled, you can’t defeat them like regular enemies or even previous boss fights. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each one possesses different abilities that force you to change your strategy. Some bosses won’t let you get close, while others won’t give you a chance to keep your distance. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt or fall. The choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Depths of Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3051160/extras/2554cde1f7d1c35503c9c1427ce4585c.poster.avif?t=1786962680\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3051160/extras/2554cde1f7d1c35503c9c1427ce4585c.webm?t=1786962680\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3051160/extras/2554cde1f7d1c35503c9c1427ce4585c.mp4?t=1786962680\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Black State pulls you into a deep, mysterious, and emotional journey where nothing is as it seems. Every step uncovers new secrets, and every encounter brings you closer to piecing together the truth. Some doors lead to new mysteries, while others reveal the answers you seek. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The question is, are you ready to enter?</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An action-packed third-person shooter with stunning visuals and high performance. A secret scientist organization summons you for a mysterious mission; rescue captives and uncover the truth behind a cataclysmic event. But beyond the portal doors lies an unknown fate. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Black State, you'll have to stay sharp. As you search for the captives and piece together what really happened, you'll face relentless threats, hostile human forces and deadly Robosapien enemies patrolling every corner. And the bosses? They’re beyond anything you’ve ever faced. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step carefully, every door you open could lead to salvation or straight into a nightmare. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to open them?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Real-Time Portal Doors</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3051160/extras/855bc652ba43040ae4697c06c8ecc80a.poster.avif?t=1786962680\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3051160/extras/855bc652ba43040ae4697c06c8ecc80a.webm?t=1786962680\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3051160/extras/855bc652ba43040ae4697c06c8ecc80a.mp4?t=1786962680\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Black State, some doors are anything but ordinary. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What seems like a normal doorway can open instantly into a completely different location. In a split second, you can move between places that feel wildly different from one another. No waiting. Just pure, seamless po